.\" man page create by R# package system.
.TH GENEEXPRESSION 1 2000-1月 "cmeans_matrix" "cmeans_matrix"
.SH NAME
cmeans_matrix \- get cluster membership matrix
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIcmeans_matrix(\fBpattern\fR as any, 
\fBmemberCutoff\fR as double = 0.8, 
\fBempty_shared\fR as integer = 2, 
\fBmax_cluster_shared\fR as integer = 3, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
get cluster membership matrix
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBpattern\fB \fR\- 
 the cmeans clustering result, which can be an 
 @\fBT:SMRUCC.genomics.Visualize.ExpressionPattern.ExpressionPattern\fR object, a data frame object of the 
 membership matrix, or a pipeline object that produces a set of the 
 @\fBT:Microsoft.VisualBasic.DataMining.KMeans.EntityClusterModel\fR cluster model data.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBmemberCutoff\fB \fR\- 
 the membership cutoff value for assign a gene feature into the target 
 cluster: the gene feature will be assigned into the cluster if its 
 membership value is greater than this threshold ratio of the max membership 
 value of the corresponding cluster.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBempty_shared\fB \fR\- 
 how many clusters will be assigned to a gene feature when there is no 
 cluster that its membership value is greater than the 
 \fBmemberCutoff\fR threshold.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBmax_cluster_shared\fB \fR\- 
 the max cluster numbers that a gene feature can be assigned into.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a vector of the @\fBT:Microsoft.VisualBasic.DataMining.KMeans.EntityClusterModel\fR cluster model data: the 
 \fBID\fR property is the gene feature id, the \fBProperties\fR property is the 
 membership value of the gene feature to each cluster(\fB#1\fR, \fB#2\fR, ...), 
 and the \fBCluster\fR property is the cluster tag that the gene feature has 
 been assigned into(multiple cluster tags are joined by the \fB;\fR 
 character);
 
 this function returns a R# error message object if the input data can not 
 be cast to a collection of the cluster model data.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
geneExpression
.SH FILES
.PP
phenotype_kit.dll
.PP
